Z||000032||CUTTER||09-28-1999||04:27 PM||||Wins:<BR>Dodge Daytona 4cyl turbo<BR>Dodge Daytona 6cyl 3.1L<BR>Chevy Nova 6cyl<BR>about 8 GTI's, Jettas and Golfs<BR>Mustang 6cyl<BR>Mustang 4cyl<BR>Oldsmobile 6cyl, 80's<BR>Chevy Beretta GT 3.1L v6<BR>91 Chevy Camaro 3.4L v6<P>Close Calls:<BR>Dodge Stealth 24V DOHC v6<BR>new eagle Talon 4cyl turbo<P>Losses:<BR>91 mustang 5.0, 1/8mile 2car lengths<BR>Chevy Truck 350ci v8, a few car lengths<P>I have a almost stock 87GT, flowmasters and run 94octane all the time, what do you think it will do in the 1/4 mile? It runs reall good and has 83,000 miles.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000033||BlackGT||09-30-1999||10:51 AM||||I know better than this but I can`t wait until I 1get my 86GT put back together so I can go out and embarrass some of these idiots<BR>here in Atlanta who seem to think that a loud exhaust and so stickers make a car fast! I`ve<BR>been dusting off and out driving these mental midgets with a 95 mazda 626 LX but they keep showing up next to me at lights!!! I`m having a new rebuilt stock 2.8 V6 put in with a Centerforce clutch, I`m porting the stock exhaust manifolds adding Flowmaster exhaust a K&N filter, short shifter and NO STINKING DECALS!!! I want to keep`em guessing as to what the hell I`m driving and what`s in it!!!||||reg||1
